msgid "Relativistic corrections"
msgstr "相对论校正"

msgid ""
"There are three ways in Molpro  to take into account scalar relativistic "
"effects:"
msgstr "在 Molpro 中，有三种方法可以考虑标量相对论效应："

msgid ""
"Use the Douglas-Kroll-Hess or eXact-2-Component (X2C) relativistic one-"
"electron integrals."
msgstr "使用 Douglas-Kroll-Hess 或精确二分量 (X2C) 相对论单电子积分。"

msgid ""
"Compute a perturbational correction using the Cowan-Griffin operator (see "
"section `One-electron operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__)."
msgstr ""
"使用 Cowan-Griffin 算符计算微扰校正（参见章节 `单电子算符和期望值 (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Using the Douglas–Kroll–Hess or eXact-2-Component Hamiltonians"
msgstr "使用 Douglas–Kroll–Hess 或精确二分量哈密顿量"

msgid "or for X2C by setting"
msgstr "或对于X2C，通过设置"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, these values can be given as options on the ``INT`` command:"
msgstr "或者，这些值也可以作为\\ ``INT``\\ 命令的选项给出："

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid "``INT,DKHO=101``"
msgstr "``INT,DKHO=101``"

msgid ""
"The value of ``DKHP`` specifies the parametrization for the DKH treatment "
"(it has no effect for X2C):"
msgstr "``DKHP`` 的值指定了DKH处理的参数化方式（对X2C无影响）："

msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

msgid "``SET,DKHO=8``"
msgstr "``SET,DKHO=8``"

msgid "DKH order = 8"
msgstr "DKH 阶数 = 8"

msgid "``SET,DKHP=2``"
msgstr "``SET,DKHP=2``"

msgid ""
"choose exponential parametrization for unitary transformations (recommended)"
msgstr "选择指数参数化用于酉变换（推荐）"

msgid ""
"See `here <program_control.html#example-for-computing-relativistic-"
"corrections>`__ for an example for computing relativistic corrections."
msgstr ""
"有关计算相对论校正的示例，请参见 `此处 "
"<program_control.html#exampleforcomputingrelativisticcorrections>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Use relativistic effective core potentials (see section :doc:`effective core"
" potentials <effective_core_potentials>`)."
msgstr "使用相对论有效芯势（参见章节 :doc:`有效芯势 <effective_core_potentials>`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"For all-electron calculations, the preferred way is to use either the "
"Douglas–Kroll–Hess (DKH) or eXact-2-Component (X2C) Hamiltonians, the former"
" of which is available up to (in principle) arbitrary order in Molpro. DKH "
"is activated by setting any of"
msgstr ""
"对于全电子计算，首选的方法是使用 Douglas–Kroll–Hess（DKH）或 eXact-2-Component（X2C）哈密顿量，前者在 "
"Molpro 中原则上可支持任意阶。通过设置以下任一项来启用 DKH"

msgid ""
"``SET,DKROLL=1\\\\`` ``SET,DKHO=$n$,  ($n=2,\\dots,99$),\\\\`` "
"``SET,DKHP=$m$,  ($m=1,\\dots,5$)``"
msgstr ""
"``SET,DKROLL=1\\\\`` ``SET,DKHO=$n$,  ($n=2,\\dots,99$),\\\\`` "
"``SET,DKHP=$m$,  ($m=1,\\dots,5$)``"

msgid ""
"``SET,DKHO=101\\\\`` somewhere in the input before the first energy "
"calculation."
msgstr "``SET,DKHO=101\\\\``\\ ，置于输入中第一次能量计算之前的某处。"

msgid "``INT,[DKROLL=1],DKHO=$n$,DKHP=$m$.``"
msgstr "``INT,[DKROLL=1],DKHO=$n$,DKHP=$m$.``"

msgid ""
"The DKH option ``DKROLL`` is available for compatibility with earlier "
"versions of Molpro. If only ``DKROLL=1`` is given, the default for ``DKHO`` "
"is 2. Setting ``DKROLL=0`` disables DKH and X2C, independently of the "
"setting of ``DKHO``. DKH is also disabled by setting ``DKHO=0``, unless "
"``DKROLL=1`` is set. In order to avoid confusion, it is recommended only to "
"use ``DKHO`` and never set ``DKROLL``. Any of these values must be given "
"AFTER the basis input."
msgstr ""
"DKH 选项 ``DKROLL`` 是为了与早期版本的 Molpro 兼容而提供的。如果只给出了 ``DKROLL=1``\\ ，则 ``DKHO`` "
"的默认值为 2。设置 ``DKROLL=0`` 会禁用 DKH 和 X2C，与 ``DKHO`` 的设置无关。除非设置了 ``DKROLL=1``\\ "
"，否则设置 ``DKHO=0`` 也会禁用 DKH。为避免混淆，建议只使用 ``DKHO`` 而绝不设置 ``DKROLL``\\ "
"。这些值中的任何一个都必须在基组输入之后给出。"

msgid "**``DKHP=1``:** Optimum parametrization (OPT, default)"
msgstr "**``DKHP=1``：** 最优参数化（OPT，默认）"

msgid "**``DKHP=2``:** Exponential parametrization (EXP)"
msgstr "**``DKHP=2``：** 指数参数化（EXP）"

msgid "**``DKHP=3``:** Square-root parametrization (SQR)"
msgstr "**``DKHP=3``：** 平方根参数化（SQR）"

msgid "**``DKHP=4``:** McWeeny parametrization (MCW)"
msgstr "**``DKHP=4``：** McWeeny 参数化（MCW）"

msgid "**``DKHP=5``:** Cayley parametrization (CAY)"
msgstr "**``DKHP=5``：** Cayley 参数化（CAY）"

msgid "!"
msgstr "!"

msgid ""
"Up to fourth order (``DKHO=4``) the DKH Hamiltonian is independent of the "
"chosen parametrization. Higher-order DKH Hamiltonians depend slightly on the"
" chosen parametrization of the unitary transformations applied in order to "
"decouple the Dirac Hamiltonian."
msgstr ""
"直到四阶（\\ ``DKHO=4``\\ ），DKH 哈密顿量与所选参数化无关。更高阶的 DKH 哈密顿量会略微依赖于为解耦 Dirac "
"哈密顿量所施加的酉变换所选的参数化。"

msgid ""
"For details on the infinite-order DKH Hamiltonians see M. Reiher, A. Wolf, "
"JCP **121**, 2037–2047 (2004), M. Reiher, A. Wolf, JCP **121**, 10945–10956 "
"(2004)."
msgstr ""
"关于无限阶 DKH 哈密顿量的细节，参见 M. Reiher, A. Wolf, JCP **121**, 2037–2047 (2004), M. "
"Reiher, A. Wolf, JCP **121**, 10945–10956 (2004)。"

msgid ""
"For details on the different parametrizations of the unitary transformations"
" see A. Wolf, M. Reiher, B. A. Hess, JCP **117**, 9215–9226 (2002)."
msgstr ""
"关于酉变换不同参数化的细节，参见 A. Wolf, M. Reiher, B. A. Hess, JCP **117**, 9215–9226 "
"(2002)。"

msgid ""
"The current implementation is the polynomial-cost algorithm by Peng and "
"Hirao: D. Peng, K. Hirao, JCP 130, 044102 (2009). A detailed comparison of "
"the capabilities of this implementation as well as the current "
"implementation of the X2C approach is provided in: D. Peng, M. Reiher, TCA "
"131, 1081 (2012)."
msgstr ""
"当前的实现是 Peng 和 Hirao 的多项式代价算法：D. Peng, K. Hirao, JCP 130, 044102 "
"(2009)。关于此实现以及当前 X2C 方法实现能力的详细比较，见：D. Peng, M. Reiher, TCA 131, 1081 (2012)。"
